The page loads no third-party code at runtime. web/dist/*.js are esbuild bundles of:

  @noble/curves 2.4.0   MIT
  @noble/hashes 2.4.0   MIT
  @qntx/ur              MIT OR Apache-2.0  (bytewords, which is what the device encodes with)
  qrcode-generator 1.5.0  MIT
  jsqr 1.4.0            Apache-2.0

built by `npm run bundle` from vendor-entry.js and scan-entry.js. License headers are kept inline
in the bundles; the full texts ship with the packages in web/node_modules.
